WEBVTT

00:05:57.583 --> 00:06:01.893
Now, these three countries
are about as geographically distant

00:06:01.917 --> 00:06:03.476
and diverse as you can get,

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.268
but they've come together

00:06:05.292 --> 00:06:07.851
on the basis of a shared value,

00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:09.809
which is a common understanding

00:06:09.833 --> 00:06:12.976
that there is more to government policy

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.184
than merely GDP.

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:16.934
Similarly, in the future,

00:06:16.958 --> 00:06:19.643
other small countries and city-states --

00:06:19.667 --> 00:06:23.184
Singapore, Switzerland,
the United Arab Emirates --

00:06:23.208 --> 00:06:26.684
will find that they have more
in common with each other

00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:28.309
than with their larger neighbors.

00:06:28.333 --> 00:06:30.559
They're all global financial centers.